Subject: [PATCH] Prepare immutable transaction signing and field bounds once
 for VM invocations

Review correction: Prepare immutable transaction signing and field bounds once for VM invocations.

This isolated V2 candidate change preserves the existing Bitcoin parser and
mainnet parameters. Module tests do not establish lotusd block acceptance.
---
